## 5.  Styling (Optional)

`react-easy-stripe-checkout-pro` opens an overlay that inherits the vendor’s CSS.  
You can style the button with Tailwind or any CSS framework:

```tsx
<button
  className="px-4 py-2 bg-indigo-600 text-white rounded hover:bg-indigo-700"
  onClick={() => setShow(true)}
>
  Pay $20.00
</button>
```

---

